WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.261 --> 00:00:13.346
-This is bad.
-Done.

00:00:13.388 --> 00:00:14.681
Shoot these.

00:00:15.432 --> 00:00:16.266
Okay.

00:00:19.227 --> 00:00:21.021
Oh, Great Bodhisattva Hachiman.

00:00:32.615 --> 00:00:35.035
Pull a little harder.

00:00:35.118 --> 00:00:37.370
For better resonance.

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:48.089
-Perfect.
-Thanks.

00:00:54.971 --> 00:00:55.889
Now!

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:06.566
Let's go.

00:01:26.086 --> 00:01:28.713
Whistling arrows. Great idea.

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:37.472
Oh, no!

00:01:38.723 --> 00:01:40.016
Hold it!

00:01:43.019 --> 00:01:44.604
Got it.

00:01:45.355 --> 00:01:48.149
You're finished.

00:01:48.733 --> 00:01:50.944
Take this.

00:01:54.197 --> 00:01:55.824
What?

